    <ShortDescription>A cross-platform GNU Privacy Guard based password manager built on a privacy-first, zero-knowledge design.</ShortDescription>
    <LongDescription>Passwords is a secure, lightweight password manager that uses GNU Privacy Guard (GPG) for all encryption operations. Every secret is encrypted locally on your device using strong, open-standard cryptography. No data is uploaded, synced, or shared. The application follows a strict zero-knowledge model: only you hold the keys, and only you can decrypt your data.</LongDescription>
